\* All TLC check configs for AntflyHAReplication.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
\* TLC config for AntflyHAReplication.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyAcceptStaleTimelineAck = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    SlotProgressOrdered
    EligibleSlotsAreCurrentActiveAndNotReseed
    DurabilityCountsEligibleOnly
    SatisfiedDurabilityHasEnoughProgress
    FailClosedDoesNotAcknowledgeUnsatisfied
    FenceReceiptValid
    PromotionMatchesFenceAndSwitchRecord
    RewindRequiresRetainedFork
    SyncAckMatchesTargetTimeline
    SyncAckProgressMatchesMode
    Safety

==== BadStaleTimelineAck
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyHAReplication.tla.
\* Enables a mutant that lets a status update from a stale timeline satisfy a
\* current sync wait target.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyAcceptStaleTimelineAck = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    SyncAckMatchesTargetTimeline
